OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle workshop fire forces
OL,4,Aresidents from homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents were forced to leave their
OL,7,Fhomes after a fire broke out in a
OL,8,Fvehicle workshop in the early hours.
OL,10,FSix fire engines, a water carrier and
OL,11,Fan aerial ladder platform were sent to
OL,12,Fthe blaze on Burgess Road in
OL,13,FSwaythling, Southampton, at about 03:00
OL,14,FGMT.
OL,16,FThe fire service said: "The building
OL,17,Fwas well alight when we first arrived
OL,18,Fon scene, which led to the closure of
OL,19,Fthe road and the evacuation of nearby
OL,20,Fproperties, but fortunately there were
OL,21,Fno injuries reported."
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
