OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle workshop fire forces
OL,4,Aresidents from homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews left the scene just before 07:00
OL,7,Fand residents have been able to return
OL,8,Fhome. A crew is expected to return on
OL,9,FFriday to recheck the site.
